ADDITIONAL TERMS (NON-LICENSE, BUT PLEASE READ)
================================================================

This project is a tool for creating trainers for **offline / single-player
games that you own**. The author does not condone, encourage, or support:

  - Using this tool (or trainers built with it) against online games
    protected by anti-cheat (EAC, BattlEye, Vanguard, ClientGuard, etc.)
  - Distributing trainers for games you do not own
  - Using this tool to violate the Terms of Service of any game or service
  - Cheating in multiplayer / competitive contexts

Use responsibly. Have fun with your own single-player games. (◕‿◕)